---
model: openai/gpt-5.4-mini
input:
  schema:
    posts(array):
      id: string
      title: string
      description: string
      link: string
      pubDate: string
output:
  schema:
    id: string
    title: string
    relatedGame: string
    publisher: string
    why: string
---

You are an expert Gaming Trend Analyst and Data Extractor. Task: Analyze the
provided posts and choose the single most trending topic based on urgency,
relevance, novelty, or expected community interest. Instructions: 1. Evaluate
all posts listed below. 2. Select exactly one post as the top trend. 3. Return
only the fields required by the output schema. 4. relatedGame must be the
explicit game title when identifiable; otherwise use "N/A". 5. publisher must be
the source domain inferred from the link (for example: "IGN", "GameSpot",
"PlayStation Blog", "Xbox Wire", "VGC"). 6. why must be one objective sentence.
Posts:
{{#each posts}}
  - id:
  {{id}}
  title:
  {{title}}
  description:
  {{description}}
  link:
  {{link}}
  pubDate:
  {{pubDate}}
{{else}}
  - id: N/A title: N/A description: N/A link: N/A pubDate: N/A
{{/each}}